title: Skip unaffected Subsystem Benchmarks on pull requests

doc:
  - audience: Node Dev
    description: |
      Skip the five Subsystem Benchmarks when a pull request changes no modeled
      benchmark inputs. Select using local Cargo dependencies and shared build inputs,
      with a sparse checkout and verification of the actual CI merge commit.
      Run the full suite for unknown inputs, source paths outside their owning crate,
      selector failures, or missing outputs. Preserve cancellation and preflight checks.
      Match shared preflight's documentation exclusions while treating code under
      docs/ as a build input. Keep full benchmark runs on master and the merge queue.
      Include regression tests and historical PR replay validation. No crates require publishing.
crates: []
